			"notes": "# Changes \n- Fixed lots of major Bugs\n- Added that you can get the Enchantments now also with trading and find them in Chests\n- Changed the repair item from **emeralds** to **Emerald Blocks** (Except for the Emerald Axe and Emerald Shield)\n- Added **emeralds** as repair items for the **Emerald Shield**\n- Nerved the **Insta Tree** Enchantment that you lose 4 durability per log the enchantment break\n- Set all emerald equipment items to the same enchantability (Enchantability of netherite).\n- Made **Insta Tree** incompatible with \n  - Mending\n  - Unbreaking\n  - Eficiency\n\n# Fixed Bugs\n- Fixed that Emerald Items could not be Enchanted through the Enchanting Table\n- Fixed that Emerald Enchantments could not be obtained in survival"
		},
