			"notes": "# Changes \n- Added three new Enchantments\n<details>\n<summary><b>📗 New Enchantments</b></summary>\n\n## 💎 Vein Miner\n\nMines all of the same ores nearby the ore you breaked\n\n#### ✅️ Compatibility \n\n- Emerald Pickaxe\n\n#### 💼 Obtain\n\n- Can be enchanted on a book with an enchanting table\n\n#### ❌️ Incompatibility\n\n- Multi Break\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 Smelted\n\nGives you everything you break as smelted version\n\n#### 🔼 Different Levels \n\n- Level 1 : \n  - smelts only ores automaticly\n- Level 2 : \n  - smelts every smeltable item/block\n\n#### ✅️ Compatibility \n\n- Emerald Axe\n- Emerald Pickaxe\n\n#### 💼 Obtain\n\n- Can be enchanted on a book with an enchanting table\n\n---\n\n## 🪵 Insta Tree\n\nThe hole tree breaks if you mine 1 , 2 or 3 blocks (The blocks you have to mine are determined by the enchantment level) of the wood which are connected\n\n#### 🔼 Different Levels \n\n- Level 1 : \n  - You have to break three block of the wood of the tree that the hole tree breaks\n- Level 2 : \n  - You have to break two block of the wood of the tree that the hole tree breaks\n- Level 3 : \n  - You have to break one block of the wood of the tree that the hole tree breaks\n\n#### ✅️ Compatibility \n\n- Emerald Axe\n\n#### 💼 Obtain\n\n- Can be enchanted on a book with an enchanting table\n\n#### ❌️ Incompatibility\n\n- Multi Break\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n- Added a new Description to the Emerald Upgrade with translations\n- Changes the Order of the Emeralds Plus Enchantments Creative Tab"
		},
