			"notes": "# Changes \n#### Added new Enchantments exclusive for Emerald Equipments and a new Emeralds Plus Enchantments Creative Tab\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>New Enchantments Creative Tab</b></summary>\n\n![New Enchantments Creative Tab](https://mano-craft.github.io/Mano-Craft-Wiki/images/emeralds_plus_enchantments_tab.png)\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary><b>New Enchantments</b></summary>\n/\n\n## 💰 Trade Luck\n\nIf you mine a Workingstation which is connected with a Villager with a tool enchanted with **Trade Luck** 1 , 2 or 3.Replace the workingstation and wait till a Villager gets the job.Then open the Villagers Trade GUI.There is a 5 % Chance per enchanted armor piece of getting **Hero of the Village** .The effect level is determined by the enchantment level used to mine the workstation.The effect time us determined by the Armor Level ( Every Piece can have its own level and the time of the 4 Pieces is added before you get the effect )\n\n#### 🔼 Different Levels on Tool\n\n- Level 1 : \n  - if you get **Hero of the Village**  , you get **Hero of the Village** 1\n- Level 2 : \n  - if you get **Hero of the Village**  , you get **Hero of the Village** 2\n- Level 3 : \n  - if you get **Hero of the Village**  , you get **Hero of the Village** 3\n\n#### 🔼 Different Levels on Armor Piece\n\n- Level 1 : \n  - the time you get per armor piece is **1 to 15 seconds**\n- Level 2 : \n  - the time you get per armor piece is **15 to 30 seconds**\n- Level 3 : \n  - the time you get per armor piece is **30 to 45 seconds**\n\n#### ‼️ Only works if\n\n- Enchanted on:\n  - The tool your mining the workingstation\n  - At least on one Armor Piece\n\n#### ✅️ Compatibility \n\n- Full Emerald Armor\n- Emerald Axe\n- Emerald Pickaxe\n\n#### 💼 Obtain\n\n- Can be enchanted on a book with an enchanting table\n\n#### ❌️ Incompatibility\n\n- Multi Break\n\n---\n\n## 🪚 Multi Break\n\nIf you have Multibreak Enchanted on a tool it lets you mine multiple blocks around the block you mine . The Enchantment goes up to level 5 and a max of a 3 by 3 by 2 mining-area\n\n#### 🔼 Different Levels\n\n- Level 1 : \n  - the block direct under the block you mine will break\n- Level 2 : \n  - the area you can mine is 2 by 2 by 1 \\\n⛏️⬛\\\n⬛⬛\n- Level 3 : \n  - the area you can mine is 3 by 3 by 1 \\\n⬛⬛⬛\\\n⬛⛏️⬛\\\n⬛⬛⬛\n- Level 4 : \n  - the area you can mine is 2 by 2 by 2 \\\n⛏️🔳\\\n🔳🔳\n- Level 5 : \n  - the area you can mine is 3 by 3 by 2\\\n🔳⛏️🔳\\\n🔳🔳🔳\\\n🔳🔳🔳\n\n#### ✅️ Compatibility \n\n- Emerald Pickaxe\n- Emerald Hoe\n- Emerald Axe\n- Emerald Shovel\n\n#### 💼 Obtain\n\n- Can be enchanted on a book with an enchanting table\n\n#### ❌️ Incompatibility\n\n- Eficiency\n\n---\n\n## 🪂 Feather Shield\n\nNo matter when you shield, you won't take any fall damage.You just have to shield when you touch the ground.\n\n#### ✅️ Compatibility \n\n- Emerald Shield\n\n#### 💼 Obtain\n\n- Can be enchanted on a book with an enchanting table\n\n---\n\n## ⚔️ Village Protector\n\nMake more damage to village enemies.And no damage to villagers\n\n#### 🔼 Different Levels\n\n- Level 1 : \n  - does **1 heart** more damage to village enemies\n- Level 2 : \n  - does **1.75 hearts** more damage to village enemies\n- Level 3 : \n  - does **2.5 hearts** more damage to village enemies\n- Level 4 : \n  - does **3.25 hearts** more damage to village enemies\n\n#### ✅️ Compatibility \n\n- Emerald Axe\n- Emerald Sword\n\n#### 💼 Obtain\n\n- Can be enchanted on a book with an enchanting table\n\n---\n\n## 🛡 Village Protection\n\nVillage enemies does less damage if enchanted\n\n#### 🔼 Different Levels\n\n- Level 1 : \n  - you get 1.5 hearts less damage\n- Level 2 : \n  - you get 2.5 hearts less damage \n- Level 3 : \n  - you get 3.5 hearts less damage \n\n#### ✅️ Compatibility \n\n- Full Emerald Armor\n\n#### 💼 Obtain\n\n- Can be enchanted on a book with an enchanting table\n\n---\n\n## 🌾 Fast Farm\n\nIf you mine a fully grown crop it automaticly replants and there is a 20% to 35% Chance for a bone to drop\n\n#### 🔼 Different Levels\n\n- Level 1 : \n  - the chance to drop a bone is 20%\n- Level 2 : \n  - the chance to drop a bone is 25%\n- Level 3 : \n\n..."
